{"id":53154,"date":"2026-07-09T05:50:50","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T04:50:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-templarios\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:33:40","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:33:40","slug":"trail-dos-templarios","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-dos-templarios\/","title":{"rendered":"XV Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">XV Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 15\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos <strong>Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a <strong>27 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> em <strong>Santa Cita<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Tomar<\/strong>. Tendo como quartel-general o <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o da ACR Santa Cita<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o percorre os hist\u00f3ricos trilhos florestais do centro de Portugal, acompanhando as margens dos rios Nab\u00e3o e Z\u00eazere.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>32 km<\/strong> (Trail Longo), <strong>20 km<\/strong> (Trail Curto), <strong>14 km<\/strong> (Mini Trail) e <strong>10 km<\/strong> (Experi\u00eancia Trail e Caminhada), a prova integra os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP e o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo. O evento organizado pela <strong>ACR Santa Cita<\/strong> inclui almo\u00e7o tradicional de conv\u00edvio para todos os atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-t