<\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realizam os Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no domingo, 27 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das partidas a partir das 08h30 no Pavilh\u00e3o da ACR Santa Cita, em Tomar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza o Trail Longo (32 km \/ 1300m D+), Trail Curto (20 km \/ 800m D+), Mini Trail (14 km \/ 400m D+), Experi\u00eancia Trail (10 km \/ 350m D+) e Caminhada (10 km \/ 350m D+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a pontua\u00e7\u00e3o e circuitos associados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas integram os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP (Trail Longo Grau 2, Trail Sprint Grau 2 e Trail Jovem Grau 1), o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo e o Circuito Regional da AA Santar\u00e9m.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, pr\u00e9mio de finalista, duches balne\u00e1rios e almo\u00e7o volante (sopa, bifana, fruta e bebida).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as datas limite e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem na plataforma Trilho Perdido at\u00e9 13 de setembro, variando entre 15,00 \u20ac e 24,00 \u20ac consoante a dist\u00e2ncia e a fase de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"XV Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o ACR Santa Cita, Santa Cita\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Tomar\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ACR Santa Cita\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realizam os Trilhos dos Templ\u00e1rios 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no domingo, 27 de setembro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das partidas a partir das 08h30 no Pavilh\u00e3o da ACR Santa Cita, em Tomar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza o Trail Longo (32 km \/ 1300m D+), Trail Curto (20 km \/ 800m D+), Mini Trail (14 km \/ 400m D+), Experi\u00eancia Trail (10 km \/ 350m D+) e Caminhada (10 km \/ 350m D+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a pontua\u00e7\u00e3o e circuitos associados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas integram os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP (Trail Longo Grau 2, Trail Sprint Grau 2 e Trail Jovem Grau 1), o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo e o Circuito Regional da AA Santar\u00e9m.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, pr\u00e9mio de finalista, duches balne\u00e1rios e almo\u00e7o volante (sopa, bifana, fruta e bebida).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as datas limite e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem na plataforma Trilho Perdido at\u00e9 13 de setembro, variando entre 15,00 \u20ac e 24,00 \u20ac consoante a dist\u00e2ncia e a fase de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66197,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-53154","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-tomar-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/xv-trilhos-dos-templarios-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53154","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":